<SYNTAX BLEIB = V-STAY>

<SYNONYM BLEIB BLEIBE>

;"v-swing also v-wave. same ger. word"
<SYNTAX SCHWING OBJECT (FIND WEAPONBIT) (HELD CARRIED HAVE) = V-SWING>

<SYNTAX SCHWING ;FUCHTELE MIT OBJECT ;HERUM (FIND WEAPONBIT)
	(HELD CARRIED HAVE) = V-SWING>

